     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\nMetformin 1700 mg three times daily comes to 5,100 mg/day. The usual maximum is 2,550 mg/day for immediate-release and 2,000 mg/day for extended-release. This dose is double that, which raises the risk of lactic acidosis and GI toxicity.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **850 mg PO three times daily with meals** (2,550 mg/day, the max IR dose)\n- **1,700 mg per day**, for example 850 mg twice daily\n- A different dose altogether\n\nTell me the dose you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1,700 mg three times daily, please confirm that it's intentional, and I can add a note to the order explaining why."
      }
     ],
